abstract: >-
  A bilingual, source-backed urban and geographic atlas of Greater Cairo,
  documenting entities, claims, evidence, spatial features, and relationships.
  The repository contains separately licensed software, legacy research data,
  prospective research material, and third-party datasets. See DATA_LICENSE.md
  and LICENSE for the applicable terms; no single licence applies to all contents.
keywords:
